30943      options nosyntaxcheck obs=max firstobs=1 nodate nonumber nocenter linesize=160 pagesize=max nostimer nofullstimer validvarname=v7
30943    ! validmemname=compatible locale=en_US;
30944      %let syscc=0;
30945      title; footnote;
30946      ods _all_ close;
30947      ods listing gpath="%sysfunc(pathname(work))";
30948      ods graphics off;
30949      proc datasets library=work kill nolist;
NOTE: Deleting WORK.OUTV (memtype=DATA).
NOTE: Deleting WORK.REGSTRY (memtype=ITEMSTOR).
NOTE: File WORK.REGSTRY (memtype=ITEMSTOR) cannot be deleted because it is in use.
NOTE: Deleting WORK.SASGOPT (memtype=CATALOG).
NOTE: File WORK.SASGOPT (memtype=CATALOG) cannot be deleted because it is in use.
NOTE: Deleting WORK.SASMAC2 (memtype=CATALOG).
NOTE: Deleting WORK.SEMIVSTOREGAU (memtype=ITEMSTOR).
NOTE: Deleting WORK.TEMPLAT (memtype=ITEMSTOR).
NOTE: File WORK.TEMPLAT (memtype=ITEMSTOR) cannot be deleted because it is in use.
30949    !                                         quit;


30950      ods path work.templat(update) sashelp.tmplmst(read);
30951      
30952      title 'Spatial Correlation Analysis with PROC VARIOGRAM';
30953      ods graphics on;
30954      proc variogram data=sashelp.thick plots=pairs(thr=30);
30955      compute novariogram nhc=20;
30956      coordinates xc=East yc=North;
30957      var Thick;
30958      run;

NOTE: The PROCEDURE VARIOGRAM printed page 1942.

30959      proc variogram data=sashelp.thick outv=outv;
30960      compute lagd=7 maxlag=10 cl robust;
30961      coordinates xc=East yc=North;
30962      var Thick;
30963      run;

NOTE: No DIRECTIONS statement and no NDIRECTIONS=, or NDIRECTIONS=0 specified: Computing omnidirectional semivariogram.
NOTE: The data set WORK.OUTV has 12 observations and 9 variables.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE VARIOGRAM printed pages 1943-1944.

30964      proc variogram data=sashelp.thick outv=outv plots(only)=moran;
30965      compute lagd=7 maxlag=10 autocorr(assum=random);
30966      coordinates xc=East yc=North;
30967      var Thick;
30968      run;

NOTE: No DIRECTIONS statement and no NDIRECTIONS=, or NDIRECTIONS=0 specified: Computing omnidirectional semivariogram.
NOTE: The autocorrelation statistics exclude 33 observation(s) that have no neighbors within the specified LAGDISTANCE= distance.
NOTE: The Moran scatter plot excludes 33 observation(s) because they have no neighbors within the specified LAGDISTANCE= distance.
NOTE: The data set WORK.OUTV has 12 observations and 8 variables.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE VARIOGRAM printed pages 1945-1946.

30969      proc variogram data=sashelp.thick outv=outv;
30970      store out=SemivStoreGau / label='Thickness Gaussian WLS Fit';
30971      compute lagd=7 maxlag=10;
30972      coordinates xc=East yc=North;
30973      model form=gau cl / covb;
30974      var Thick;
30975      run;

NOTE: No DIRECTIONS statement and no NDIRECTIONS=, or NDIRECTIONS=0 specified: Computing omnidirectional semivariogram.
NOTE: Convergence criterion (GCONV=1E-8) satisfied.
NOTE: The data set WORK.OUTV has 12 observations and 8 variables.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE VARIOGRAM printed pages 1947-1950.

30976      ods graphics off;
30977      run;
30978      quit;
